## 35. One-Sentence Summary

LineageLens captures AI-assisted code insertions from any tool — Claude Code, Cursor, Aider, or any agent that writes files — using VS Code as the current observation host, correlates them with local LLM traffic when possible, normalizes them into a provider-agnostic provenance record, stores/searches/displays them locally or through a backend, and provides governance, risk, lineage, explanation, and review features while gracefully degrading for opaque tools.
